// Certutil Used to Decode a File
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_certutil_decode.yml (8a4c1260-aef7-4360-aeae-3c17b62c91a8)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1140 Deobfuscate/Decode Files or Information
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and ((process.executable:"*\\certutil.exe" or process.pe.original_file_name:"CertUtil.exe") and (process.command_line like~ ("*-decode *", "*/decode *", "*-decodehex *", "*/decodehex *")))
